  "$comment": "The thira-icons icon list, drawn in batches 1–14 and released together as 0.1.0. New batches add to it. Names follow Lucide's canonical names where the concept is the same, so switching from Lucide is easy. `used` = projects that need it today. Status is computed: run `npm run progress`.",
