    "1": "Used in thira-ui / apps today, plus the core UI basics",
    "2": "Status, account, files, communication",
    "3": "Time, data, devices, commerce",
    "4": "Everything else, and the extended Thai set",
    "5": "common gaps (editing, files and people modifiers, media and objects)",
    "6": "more actions, modifiers, weather and everyday objects",
